{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028114312613-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028114744\"/><p>聖士提反灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（10月28日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的聖士提反灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:00:57.378747+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T03:43:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:12.954845+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:31.116894+00:00","content_hash":"7b6c5eb52038688aa180b1eae13e8e579b247e23f8783b7d0986287d049dab6b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:00:57.378747+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}